        { "name": "token_program", "address": "TokenkegQfeZyiNwAJbNbGKPFXCWuBvf9Ss623VQ5DA" },
        { "name": "system_program", "address": "11111111111111111111111111111111" }
      ],
      "args": [
        { "name": "shares", "type": "u64", "docs": ["Share-token amount to burn"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "update_nav",
      "docs": [
        "Permissionless NAV refresh. Reads idle wallet balance + each protocol",
        "leg's value via PositionReader, writes nav_per_share + EMA TWAP.",
        "Dispatch byte: 3.",
        "",
        "Wire format (after the dispatch byte is stripped):",
        "  []                                           ← legacy / no positions",
        "| [num_positions: u8, protocol_tag: u8 × N]  ← extended",
        "Protocol tags: 0=Kamino, 1=Marinade, 2=Drift, 3=Marginfi.",
        "",
        "Remaining accounts (after the 4 fixed): for each position i in 0..N,",
        "  [4 + 2i + 0] holding_acc        — SPL token acct (cToken/mSOL/lp)",
        "  [4 + 2i + 1] exchange_rate_acc  — protocol-owned rate source"
      ],
      "discriminator": [3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
      "accounts": [
        { "name": "cranker", "signer": true },
        { "name": "strategy", "writable": true },
        { "name": "nav_oracle", "writable": true },
        { "name": "wallet_token_ata", "docs": ["Wallet's quote-token ATA (idle balance)"] }
      ],
      "args": [
        { "name": "num_positions", "type": "u8", "docs": ["0 in legacy mode; otherwise N protocol tags follow"] },
        { "name": "protocol_tags", "type": "bytes", "docs": ["N bytes; tag per deployed leg (0=Kamino, 1=Marinade, 2=Drift, 3=Marginfi)"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "rebalance",
      "docs": [
        "Authority-only rebalance step (single step in this hackathon build).",
        "Routes via Beethoven (Deposit/Withdraw/Swap). Dispatch byte: 4.",
        "",
        "Wire format (after the dispatch byte is stripped):",
        "  num_steps: u8 (must be 1)",
        "  action: u8 (0=DEPOSIT, 1=WITHDRAW, 2=SWAP)",
        "  amount: u64 LE",
        "  if action == SWAP: min_out: u64 LE",
        "Remaining accounts are the Beethoven context for the chosen action."
      ],
      "discriminator": [4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
      "accounts": [
        { "name": "authority", "signer": true },
        { "name": "strategy", "writable": true }
      ],
      "args": [
        { "name": "num_steps", "type": "u8" },
        { "name": "action", "type": "u8", "docs": ["0=DEPOSIT, 1=WITHDRAW, 2=SWAP"] },
        { "name": "amount", "type": "u64" },
        { "name": "min_out", "type": "u64", "docs": ["SWAP only — omit for DEPOSIT/WITHDRAW"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "snapshot_positions",
      "docs": [
        "Permissionless ~24h cadence snapshot of strategy composition into the",
        "PositionSnapshots PDA. PDA is created on first call.",
        "Dispatch byte: 5. No instruction args."
      ],
      "discriminator": [5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
      "accounts": [
        { "name": "keeper", "writable": true, "signer": true },
        { "name": "strategy" },
        {
          "name": "position_snapshots",
          "writable": true,
          "pda": {
            "seeds": [
              { "kind": "const", "value": [112, 111, 115, 105, 116, 105, 111, 110, 95, 115, 110, 97, 112, 115, 104, 111, 116, 115] },
              { "kind": "account", "path": "strategy" }
            ]
          }
        },
        { "name": "system_program", "address": "11111111111111111111111111111111" }
      ],
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "name": "init_position",
      "docs": [
        "Permissionless one-shot per-strategy protocol setup (e.g. Kamino UserMetadata",
        "+ Obligation init). Routes via beethoven::DepositInit. Dispatch byte: 6.",
        "No instruction args. Remaining accounts = protocol-specific init context."
      ],
      "discriminator": [6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
      "accounts": [
        { "name": "authority", "writable": true, "signer": true },
        { "name": "strategy" }
      ],
      "args": []
    },
    {
      "name": "perp_place_order",
      "docs": [
        "Open or close a perp position via Beethoven::Perps (Mango v4 today).",
        "One dispatch byte covers both: closing a long is side=Ask + reduce_only=true.",
        "Dispatch byte: 7.",
        "",
        "Wire format (44 bytes after the dispatch byte):",
        "  side: u8 (0=Bid, 1=Ask)",
        "  price_lots: i64 LE",
        "  max_base_lots: i64 LE",
        "  max_quote_lots: i64 LE",
        "  client_order_id: u64 LE",
        "  order_type: u8 (0=Limit, 1=IOC, 2=PostOnly, 3=Market, 4=PostOnlySlide)",
        "  reduce_only: u8 (0/1)",
        "  expiry_ts: u64 LE (0 = no expiry)",
        "  limit: u8 (book-iteration cap)"
      ],
      "discriminator": [7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
      "accounts": [
        { "name": "authority", "signer": true },
        { "name": "strategy", "writable": true }
      ],
      "args": [
        { "name": "side", "type": "u8" },
        { "name": "price_lots", "type": "i64" },
        { "name": "max_base_lots", "type": "i64" },
        { "name": "max_quote_lots", "type": "i64" },
        { "name": "client_order_id", "type": "u64" },
        { "name": "order_type", "type": "u8" },
        { "name": "reduce_only", "type": "u8" },
        { "name": "expiry_ts", "type": "u64" },
        { "name": "limit", "type": "u8" }
      ]
    }
